r than on independent groups of rows.\",\n    \"The selected report demonstrates absence of the row-independence violation: it explicitly states the 72 run rows are not 72 independent observations, describes collapsing runs to one pre mean and one post mean per mussel_id, and applies a paired t-test to the 12 within-animal changes.\",\n    \"The reported degrees of freedom, t(11), match n = 12 independent units minus one, not the 72 raw rows (which would have produced df of 70 or 71 under a row-level analysis), confirming the test was run on the collapsed per-animal table.\",\n    \"Recomputation from data/input.csv verifies the report's numbers: all 12 per-animal pre/post means and changes match (e.g., MU-01 pre 3.400, post 2.500, change -0.900), mean change -0.917 L/h, SD 0.212, SE 0.0613, t = -14.944 on 11 df, and 95% CI -1.052 to -0.782 using t_crit(11) = 2.201; the workflow code performs exactly the collapse the report describes.\",\n    \"No authority lock was minted, so lock conformance to the declaration cannot be assessed; the answer is not-applicable-no-lock.\"\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":18127,"ttft_stream_ms":1713,"time_to_request_ms":17,"type":"result","duration_ms":26225,"uuid":"c1ce9ba3-0952-4881-b2a1-82a87597a438"}
